{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000017368","bookName":"Casada por error, amada por destino","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000017368/42000017368.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":2192871,"followCount":42106,"introduction":"A los 8 años, la madre de Selena se vuelve a casar. Vive hostigada por su padrastro, pero su madre no le cree. Desesperada, acepta casarse para huir. Confunde la cita y acaba casada con Yared, el tío de su amiga, el hombre más poderoso de la ciudad. Él la esperaba desde hace tiempo. Tras la boda, enfrenta hostigamiento y provocaciones. Yared la protege y lo resuelve todo. Su madre descubre la verdad y se arrepiente. Selena encuentra el amor callado de Yared y, la felicidad.","chapterCount":60,"labels":["Family Bonds","Love After Marriage"],"tags":["Family Bonds","Love After Marriage"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Casada-por-error-amada-por-destino","bookNameLower":"casada-por-error-amada-por-destino","shelfTime":"2026-06-17 16:38:09","firstShelfTime":"2026-06-17 16:38:09","performerList":[{"performerId":"26074","performerName":"Miaoyan Cai","performerFormatName":"Miaoyan-Cai","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x7/26074/26074.jpg?time=1785988544540","videoCount":5},{"performerId":"29591","performerName":"Xaiofan Ma","performerFormatName":"Xaiofan-Ma","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/1x9/29591/29591.jpg?time=1783047794324","videoCount":1}],"performerIdList":[26074,29591]},"chapterList":[{"id":"701070762","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/26/8x6/86x3/863x7/86371000024/701070762_1/701070762.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795219200&Signature=iRgIYcrVwjUfjFpkEfkdM9CYacIVVNJlyFleoDCfkFIgQ87e11D82YeeoUuMUFkqgxXkf7BTmE489VPPz19HgyxCrkQ2v6U3hMma2QRTwc39KQCv